# Boost on 56's end save (AUTHORING.md, Boosts): party strength only, the story stays played.
# The Elite Four and Cynthia come with no Pokemon Center between them (trdata.json #261-#264, #267). The chain's two
# fighters go to level 100 with their moves set again (PP full): Torterra (slot 0) and Gyarados (slot 3, 55's boost).
# Stone Edge for Aaron's bugs, Seed Bomb and Waterfall for Bertha's grounds, Earthquake and Waterfall for Flint's
# fires, Crunch for Lucian's psychics, Ice Fang for Cynthia's Garchomp (4x). On a lab start slot 0 is Garchomp and
# slot 3 Bibarel: the same moves serve them.
party-level 0 100
party-move 0 0 MOVE_EARTHQUAKE
party-move 0 1 MOVE_STONE_EDGE
party-move 0 2 MOVE_CRUNCH
party-move 0 3 MOVE_SEED_BOMB
party-level 3 100
party-move 3 0 MOVE_WATERFALL
party-move 3 1 MOVE_ICE_FANG
party-move 3 2 MOVE_CRUNCH
party-move 3 3 MOVE_EARTHQUAKE
